  "description": "Vietnam tax system at a glance for 2026. Use to find which Vietnam skill answers a question and for the headline figures that changed in 2025 and 2026 - new laws on personal income tax (Law 109/2025/QH15), corporate income tax (Law 67/2025/QH15), tax administration (Law 108/2025/QH15), the April 2026 amending Law 09/2026/QH16, the VND 1 billion threshold for household businesses and very small companies (Decree 141/2026), the end of the business licence fee and the mid-2026 social insurance cap. Tier 2, not reviewed by an accountant.",
